      <div class="Section3">
        <a name="annex-examples" id="annex-examples"></a>
        <h1 class="Annex"><b>Annex B</b><br/>(informative)<br/><b>Examples</b></h1>
        <p style="display:none;" class="variant-title-toc">Annex B<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Examples</p>
        <div><a name="_ec9ff897-1e0b-495f-7c3d-44f4ec99a137" id="_ec9ff897-1e0b-495f-7c3d-44f4ec99a137"></a><h2>B.1<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>GetCapabilities</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_f99985df-640b-981a-eca8-b9575bc980d5" id="_f99985df-640b-981a-eca8-b9575bc980d5"></a>An example of a <b>GetCapabilities</b> HTTP GET request and XML response from an actual server is as below. DNS names were changed.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_70c0c0c0-89ce-577e-347c-203717942b05" id="_70c0c0c0-89ce-577e-347c-203717942b05"></a><tt><a href="http://example.com/wami/CS?service=CS&request=GetCapabilities&version=1.0.0&AcceptFormats=text/xml">http://example.com/wami/CS?service=CS&amp;request=GetCapabilities&amp;version=1.0.0&amp;AcceptFormats=text/xml</a></tt></p>

<p class="Sourcecode"><a name="_f5baa347-c18d-87f6-25fc-9a6fb67bf9df" id="_f5baa347-c18d-87f6-25fc-9a6fb67bf9df"></a><span class="cp">&lt;?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns3:Capabilities</span> <span class="na">version=</span><span class="s">"1.0.0"</span> <span class="na">xmlns:ns2=</span><span class="s">"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"</span> <span class="na">xmlns:ns1=</span><span class="s">"http://www.opengis.net/ows/2.0"</span> <span class="na">xmlns:ns3=</span><span class="s">"http://www.pixia.com/wami"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:ServiceIdentification&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Title&gt;</span>Collection Service<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Title&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:ServiceType&gt;</span>CS<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:ServiceType&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:ServiceTypeVersion&gt;</span>1.0.0<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:ServiceTypeVersion&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:ServiceIdentification&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:ServiceProvider&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:ProviderName&gt;</span>Pixia Corp<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:ProviderName&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:ServiceContact/&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:ServiceProvider&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:OperationsMetadata&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Operation</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"GetCollectionCount"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:DCP&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:HTTP&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Get</span> <span class="na">ns2:type=</span><span class="s">"simple"</span> <span class="na">ns2:href=</span><span class="s">"http://example.com/wami/CS"</span><span class="nt">/&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:HTTP&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:DCP&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"Service"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>CS<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"Request"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>GetCollectionCount<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"Version"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>1.0.0<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"Format"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>application/xml<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>application/json<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:DefaultValue&gt;</span>application/xml<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:DefaultValue&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"AcceptLanguages"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>en-US<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>en<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:DefaultValue&gt;</span>en-US<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:DefaultValue&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"NID"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AnyValue/&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"Depth"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>1<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>All<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:DefaultValue&gt;</span>All<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:DefaultValue&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"Bbox"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AnyValue/&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Meaning&gt;</span>Bounding box to filter collections wholly outside the box.<span class="nt">&lt;/Meaning&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"CRS"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>EPSG:4326<span class="nt">&lt;/Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>EPSG:4269<span class="nt">&lt;/Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>EPSG:32645<span class="nt">&lt;/Value&gt;</span><br/><spa