/span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>All<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>None<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>Collection<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>GeoBox<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>File<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:DefaultValue&gt;</span>None<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:DefaultValue&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"Depth"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>0<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>1<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>All<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:DefaultValue&gt;</span>0<span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:DefaultValue&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"Bbox"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AnyValue/&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Meaning&gt;</span>Bounding box to filter collections wholly outside the box.<span class="nt">&lt;/Meaning&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"CRS"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>EPSG:4326<span class="nt">&lt;/Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>EPSG:4269<span class="nt">&lt;/Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Value&gt;</span>EPSG:32645<span class="nt">&lt;/Value&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:AllowedValues&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Meaning&gt;</span>Coordinate reference system for BBox<span class="nt">&lt;/Meaning&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Parameter</span> <span class="na">name=</span><span class="s">"Time"</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:AnyValue/&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns1:Meaning&gt;</span>ISO 8601 time interval<span class="nt">&lt;/Meaning&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Parameter&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:Operation&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns1:OperationsMetadata&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns3:Language&gt;</span>en-US<span class="nt">&lt;/ns3:Language&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;ns3:Language&gt;</span>en<span class="nt">&lt;/ns3:Language&gt;</span><br/><span class="nt">&lt;/ns3:Capabilities&gt;</span></p>

